## Corresponding Source

The source code is public at <https://github.com/Iwillbewarlock/HeartOfMagic>.

- This package was made from commit `@COMMIT@`: <https://github.com/Iwillbewarlock/HeartOfMagic/tree/@COMMIT@>
- Both binaries were built from commit `@BUILD_COMMIT@`. The packaging script checked that every file they are
  compiled from is the same in both commits (the later commit changes only documents, data and packaging).
- @COMMONLIB_SOURCE@
- The other libraries come from the vcpkg manifest `vcpkg.json` (triplet `x64-windows-static`). Building:
  `BuildRelease.ps1 -preset Release-2026` (see the repository's README and CLAUDE.md).

